    "about_overview": "Loyal Adani One customers can save on their spends by redeeming accumulated reward points against spends within the Adani One ecosystem. Frequent travellers who prefer to book through Adani One can also avail premium travel benefits, including complimentary lounge access worldwide, porter services, premium car parking , and more—making it a suitable option for frequent travellers. While the card focuses on travel and lifestyle categories, it offers limited lounge access benefits and charges a high forex markup fee of 3.5%, which may impact its overall value. However, if you frequently travel and shop within the Adani One ecosystem, this card can help you save significantly.",
